cff-version: 1.2.0
title: "mtl-roofs: LOD2 roof reconstruction and evaluation for Montréal"
message: "If you use this software or its results, please cite it."
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: Baluev
    given-names: Grigory
repository-code: "https://github.com/grigorybaluev/mtl-roofs"
url: "https://grigorybaluev.github.io/mtl-roofs/"
abstract: >-
  Reconstructs LOD2 building roofs for Montréal from open aerial LiDAR and building
  footprints, and evaluates every reconstruction against the City of Montréal's own
  LOD2 CityGML building model using vertical RMSE, plane orientation error, topology
  agreement and coverage, broken down by roof type, building size and point density.
keywords:
  - lidar
  - 3d-reconstruction
  - lod2
  - citygml
  - point-cloud
  - computational-geometry
  - geospatial
  - montreal
license: MIT
version: 0.0.0
